{
  "title": "Icon",
  "description": "Icons from the NYSDS set at several sizes, turned, flipped, and colored with tokens.",
  "html": "<h1 class=\"nys-font-h3\">Icon</h1>\n\n<p class=\"nys-font-ui-md nys-margin-b-100\">Sizes</p>\n<div class=\"nys-display-flex nys-flex-wrap nys-flex-align-end nys-flex-gap-400 nys-margin-b-400\">\n  <div class=\"nys-display-flex nys-flex-column nys-flex-align-center nys-flex-gap-100\">\n    <nys-icon name=\"check_circle\" size=\"md\"></nys-icon>\n    <span class=\"nys-font-ui-sm\">md</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"nys-display-flex nys-flex-column nys-flex-align-center nys-flex-gap-100\">\n    <nys-icon name=\"check_circle\" size=\"xl\"></nys-icon>\n    <span class=\"nys-font-ui-sm\">xl</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"nys-display-flex nys-flex-column nys-flex-align-center nys-flex-gap-100\">\n    <nys-icon name=\"check_circle\" size=\"3xl\"></nys-icon>\n    <span class=\"nys-font-ui-sm\">3xl</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"nys-display-flex nys-flex-column nys-flex-align-center nys-flex-gap-100\">\n    <nys-icon name=\"check_circle\" size=\"5xl\"></nys-icon>\n    <span class=\"nys-font-ui-sm\">5xl</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"nys-font-ui-md nys-margin-b-100\">Rotated, flipped, and colored with tokens</p>\n<div class=\"nys-display-flex nys-flex-wrap nys-flex-align-center nys-flex-gap-300 nys-margin-b-400\">\n  <nys-icon name=\"arrow_forward\" size=\"5xl\"></nys-icon>\n  <nys-icon name=\"arrow_forward\" size=\"5xl\" rotate=\"90\"></nys-icon>\n  <nys-icon name=\"arrow_forward\" size=\"5xl\" flip=\"horizontal\"></nys-icon>\n  <nys-icon name=\"info\" size=\"5xl\" color=\"var(--nys-color-theme)\" ariaLabel=\"Information\"></nys-icon>\n  <nys-icon name=\"check_circle\" size=\"5xl\" color=\"var(--nys-color-success)\" ariaLabel=\"Complete\"></nys-icon>\n  <nys-icon name=\"error\" size=\"5xl\" color=\"var(--nys-color-danger)\" ariaLabel=\"Error\"></nys-icon>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"nys-display-flex nys-flex-align-center nys-flex-gap-300\">\n  <nys-icon id=\"turn-icon\" name=\"arrow_upward\" size=\"5xl\"></nys-icon>\n  <nys-button id=\"turn-button\" label=\"Turn 90 degrees\" variant=\"outline\"></nys-button>\n</div>\n<p id=\"log\" role=\"status\" class=\"nys-margin-t-200\">The arrow points up.</p>\n\n<p class=\"nys-font-body-sm nys-margin-t-500\"><a href=\"https://designsystem.ny.gov/components/icon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Icon docs</a></p>\n",
  "css": "",
  "js": "const icon = document.getElementById('turn-icon');\nconst log = document.getElementById('log');\nconst directions = ['up', 'right', 'down', 'left'];\nlet turns = 0;\n\n// rotate is a property like any other. Set it and the icon redraws.\ndocument.getElementById('turn-button').addEventListener('nys-click', () => {\n  turns += 1;\n  icon.rotate = String((turns % 4) * 90);\n  log.textContent = `The arrow points ${directions[turns % 4]}.`;\n});\n",
  "notes": "NYSDS ships a curated subset of Material Symbols. A name outside that set renders as empty space, so check the icon docs before you pick one. Give an icon an ariaLabel only when it carries meaning on its own."
}
